  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">COBBLEMORE LIBRARY</h1>\n<p>◽系統用於儲存我的模組之間共用的所有物品/資源/配方/程式碼。<br>◽此系統為我部分模組所必需。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><br>我的模組：</h2>\n<p><a title=\"Cobblemon: Create Industries\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-create-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cobblemon: Create Industries</a>：Cobblemon 與 Create 的整合模組，包含寶貝球、物品、糖果等配方。<br><a title=\"Cobblemon: Additions &amp; Tools\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-additions-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cobblemon: Additions &amp; Tools</a>：新增由進化石製作的盔甲、工具與武器。<br><a title=\"Cobblemon: Simple Pokecenter's\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-simple-pokecenters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cobblemon: Simple Pokecenter's</a>：新增附有治療機與電腦的寶可夢中心。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
